\n<p>Implemented backend logic to manage <strong>student, teacher, and staff data</strong>, improving the reliability of academic and administrative processes.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Collaborated directly with <strong>administrative staff, teachers, and students</strong> to gather requirements, validate features, and iteratively improve the system.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Applied best practices in backend development, focusing on <strong>code organization, maintainability, and scalability</strong> in a real institutional environment.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Desarrollador de Software (Voluntario)","company":"ETEC Taboão da Serra","location":"São Paulo, Brasil","range":"Feb 2024 - Presente","url":"https://www.cps.sp.gov.br/etec/","lang":"es","logo":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/Portfolio/static/92fc5250002476da4420893615f19fd6/da65b/logo.jpg","srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/92fc5250002476da4420893615f19fd6/5e2a0/logo.jpg 40w,\n/Portfolio/static/92fc5250002476da4420893615f19fd6/483ca/logo.jpg 80w,\n/Portfolio/static/92fc5250002476da4420893615f19fd6/da65b/logo.jpg 160w,\n/Portfolio/static/92fc5250002476da4420893615f19fd6/f6fcd/logo.jpg 320w","sizes":"(min-width: 160px) 160px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/92fc5250002476da4420893615f19fd6/f757c/logo.avif 40w,\n/Portfolio/static/92fc5250002476da4420893615f19fd6/147f1/logo.avif 80w,\n/Portfolio/static/92fc5250002476da4420893615f19fd6/11764/logo.avif 160w,\n/Portfolio/static/92fc5250002476da4420893615f19fd6/60b5b/logo.avif 320w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 160px) 160px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/92fc5250002476da4420893615f19fd6/e7f45/logo.webp 40w,\n/Portfolio/static/92fc5250002476da4420893615f19fd6/09f82/logo.webp 80w,\n/Portfolio/static/92fc5250002476da4420893615f19fd6/405d4/logo.webp 160w,\n/Portfolio/static/92fc5250002476da4420893615f19fd6/dde70/logo.webp 320w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 160px) 160px, 100vw"}]},"width":160,"height":107}}}},"html":"<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Desarrollé y mantuve un <strong>sistema de gestión escolar (SAGE)</strong> para apoyar operaciones académicas y administrativas, incluyendo registros de estudiantes, asistencia y flujos de trabajo internos.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Diseñé e implementé <strong>APIs RESTful</strong> usando <strong>Node.js</strong> y <strong>Express.js</strong>, aplicando una estructura clara de endpoints, validación y reglas de negocio.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Modelé y mantuve una <strong>base de datos relacional</strong>, garantizando la consistencia, integridad y un rendimiento eficiente en las consultas.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Implementé la lógica de backend para gestionar datos de <strong>estudiantes, profesores y personal</strong>, mejorando la confiabilidad de los procesos académicos y administrativos.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Colaboré directamente con <strong>personal administrativo, profesores y estudiantes</strong> para relevar requisitos, validar funcionalidades y mejorar el sistema de forma iterativa.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Apliqué buenas prácticas de desarrollo backend, enfocándome en <strong>organización del código, mantenibilidad y escalabilidad</strong> en un entorno institucional real.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"软件开发志愿者","company":"ETEC Taboão da Serra","location":"巴西圣保罗","range":"2024年2月 - 至今","url":"https://www.cps.sp.gov.br/etec/","lang":"zh","logo":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/Portfolio/static/92fc5250002476da4420893615f19fd6/da65b/logo.jpg","srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/92fc5250002476da4420893615f19fd6/5e2a0/logo.jpg 40w,\n/Portfolio/static/92fc5250002476da4420893615f19fd6/483ca/logo.jpg 80w,\n/Portfolio/static/92fc5250002476da4420893615f19fd6/da65b/logo.jpg 160w,\n/Portfolio/static/92fc5250002476da4420893615f19fd6/f6fcd/logo.jpg 320w","sizes":"(min-width: 160px) 160px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/92fc5250002476da4420893615f19fd6/f757c/logo.avif 40w,\n/Portfolio/static/92fc5250002476da4420893615f19fd6/147f1/logo.avif 80w,\n/Portfolio/static/92fc5250002476da4420893615f19fd6/11764/logo.avif 160w,\n/Portfolio/static/92fc5250002476da4420893615f19fd6/60b5b/logo.avif 320w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 160px) 160px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/92fc5250002476da4420893615f19fd6/e7f45/logo.webp 40w,\n/Portfolio/static/92fc5250002476da4420893615f19fd6/09f82/logo.webp 80w,\n/Portfolio/static/92fc5250002476da4420893615f19fd6/405d4/logo.webp 160w,\n/Portfolio/static/92fc5250002476da4420893615f19fd6/dde70/logo.webp 320w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 160px) 160px, 100vw"}]},"width":160,"height":107}}}},"html":"<ul>\n<li>\n<p>开发并维护一套<strong>学校管理系统(SAGE)</strong>,支持学术与行政运营,包括学生档案、考勤记录与内部工作流程。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>使用 <strong>Node.js</strong> 与 <strong>Express.js</strong> 设计并实现 <strong>RESTful API</strong>,应用清晰的接口结构、数据校验与业务规则。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>建模并维护<strong>关系型数据库</strong>,确保数据一致性、完整性以及高效的查询性能。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>实现后端逻辑以管理<strong>学生、教师与教职工数据</strong>,提升学术与行政流程的可靠性。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>直接与<strong>行政人员、教师与学生</strong>协作,收集需求、验证功能并持续改进系统。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>应用后端开发最佳实践,在真实的机构环境中专注于<strong>代码组织、可维护性与可扩展性</strong>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Desenvolvedor de Software (Voluntário)","company":"ETEC Taboão da Serra","location":"São Paulo, Brasil","range":"Fev 2024 - Presente","url":"https://www.cps.sp.gov.br/etec/","lang":"pt","logo":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/Portfolio/static/92fc5250002476da4420893615f19fd6/da65b/logo.jpg","srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/92fc5250002476da4420893615f19fd6/5e2a0/logo.jpg 40w,\n/Portfolio/static/92fc5250002476da4420893615f19fd6/483ca/logo.jpg 80w,\n/Portfolio/static/92fc5250002476da4420893615f19fd6/da65b/logo.jpg 160w,\n/Portfolio/static/92fc5250002476da4420893615f19fd6/f6fcd/logo.jpg 320w","sizes":"(min-width: 160px) 160px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/92fc5250002476da4420893615f19fd6/f757c/logo.avif 40w,\n/Portfolio/static/92fc5250002476da4420893615f19fd6/147f1/logo.avif 80w,\n/Portfolio/static/92fc5250002476da4420893615f19fd6/11764/logo.avif 160w,\n/Portfolio/static/92fc5250002476da4420893615f19fd6/60b5b/logo.avif 320w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 160px) 160px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/Portfolio/static/92fc5250002476da4420893615f19fd6/e7f45/logo.webp 40w,\n/Portfolio/static/92fc5250002476da4420893615f19fd6/09f82/logo.webp 80w,\n/Portfolio/static/92fc5250002476da4420893615f19fd6/405d4/logo.webp 160w,\n/Portfolio/static/92fc5250002476da4420893615f19fd6/dde70/logo.webp 320w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 160px) 160px, 100vw"}]},"width":160,"height":107}}}},"html":"<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Desenvolvi e mantive um <strong>sistema de gestão escolar (SAGE)</strong> para apoiar operações acadêmicas e administrativas, incluindo registros de alunos, frequência e fluxos de trabalho internos.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Projetei e implementei <strong>APIs RESTful</strong> usando <strong>Node.js</strong> e <strong>Express.js</strong>, aplicando estrutura clara de endpoints, validação e regras de negócio.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Modelei e mantive um <strong>banco de dados relacional</strong>, garantindo consistência, integridade dos dados e performance eficiente nas consultas.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Implementei a lógica de backend para gerenciar dados de <strong>alunos, professores e funcionários</strong>, melhorando a confiabilidade dos processos acadêmicos e administrativos.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Colaborei diretamente com <strong>equipe administrativa, professores e alunos</strong> para levantar requisitos, validar funcionalidades e melhorar o sistema iterativamente.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Apliquei boas práticas de desenvolvimento backend, focando em <strong>organização de código, manutenibilidade e escalabilidade</strong> em um ambiente institucional real.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>"}}]}}}